", "share_enabled": false, "content_type": "comment", "media_id": "3938008087860462099", "status": "Active", "type": 1, "user_id": "310386046", "strong_id__": "18099954061897544", "text": "Salah satu prajurit TNI merampas telepon genggam wartawan Tempo dan memaksa penghapusan foto-foto personel TNI yang berjaga saat peliputan di kompleks Kejaksaan Agung, Jakarta Selatan, 9 Juli 2026. Peristiwa itu terjadi ketika wartawan Tempo mendokumentasikan suasana di area belakang gedung utama, dekat Adhyaksa Cafe.\n\nDua prajurit berpangkat prajurit kepala (Praka) menghampiri wartawan Tempo sesaat setelah pengambilan gambar. Keduanya meminta telepon genggam reporter, memeriksa isi galeri, lalu meminta seluruh foto yang memuat personel TNI dihapus, termasuk dari folder sampah.\n\nBaca selengkapnya di tempo.co dan link in bio.\n\n#tempodotco #TUpdate #TNI", "user": {"pk": "310386046", "pk_id": "310386046", "id": "310386046", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841401501384849", "strong_id__": "310386046", "username": "tempodotco", "full_name": "tempo.co by Tempo Media Group", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3724210851730622579_310386046", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-gru1-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/550411618_18530886049050047_529007314515339118_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby4xMDAyLmMyIn0&_nc_ht=scontent-gru1-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGuJKzwXJJnGbh2fpoHIBl2e-OkEAeex4m8A0uQkS0PhjdJ3BinMh2Usn4-IUapMFg&_nc_ohc=nagt0u9yQkgQ7kNvwFzSfGm&_nc_gid=ENNO663XtH3JeFA3dIHhBQ&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQDwAKdsS0AbsluFGKEFk0bYdgRTy8pr10Nm_suDRl4HfA&oe=6A56BDFF&_nc_sid=ee9879"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0}, "comment_count": 604, "comment_likes_enabled": true, "comment_inform_treatment": {"action_type": null, "should_have_inform_treatment": false, "text": "", "url": null}, "is_photo_comments_composer_enabled_for_author": false, "hide_view_all_comment_entrypoint